          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.551,
            0.885,
            0.604
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "*11. The sum of the first three terms of a GP is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 3 } { 1 2 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and their product is –1. Find the common ratio and the terms."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.611,
            0.884,
            0.653
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "*12. If the 4"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "th",
              "styles": [
                "superscript"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ", 10"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "th",
              "styles": [
                "superscript"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 6 ^ { \\mathrm { t h } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " terms of a GP are x, y and z respectively, prove that x, y, z are in GP."
